  "id": "three-pepper-pasta-salad",
  "name": "Three Pepper Pasta Salad",
  "subtitle": "Colorful pasta tossed with peppers, herbs, cheese, and a bright vinaigrette.",
  "description": "A chilled pasta salad combining tri-color pasta, three bell peppers, tomato, olives, mozzarella, and a tangy herb dressing.",
